    "Derive the complete-product mixed moment from native tau power + its unshifted finite mean + genuine previously written shifted E1, at global complete scale X>=T,b<=6X. This is not assumed as E3.",
    "Generalize the actual squarefree halfProductDensity convolution identity to tau(q)^J/phi(q), yielding its true fixed logarithmic reciprocal-totient budget.",
    "Define the actual rough HB slot product from the existing native signed real-cutoff Moebius/rough-one/log roles and prove its logScale(X)^m bound; no final fullTailMass estimate is a premise.",
    "Combine actual HB slot/fibre/moment/totient budgets to derive the full complete-modulus mass polynomial, then insert the actual all-rank chart truncation error from 30c.",
    "Select H=(1+log(7X))^(accuracy+fixed derivative order+fixed paymentExponent+3), before target grows; prove its exact exponent payment. H is never selected from current finite source mass.",
    "Pay the exact b=T term using the actual physical cap D<=T^theta with theta<1 and the existing proved tau subpower theorem at epsilon=(1-theta)/2. Obtain a genuine uniform logarithmic tail saving, not one inferred from D<=6X alone.",
    "Provide the exact retained-cube actual Fourier identity and charge an honest local separated arithmetic-mode estimate only by mixedD/2^m, without H^m.",
    "Prove signed finite dyadic/rank/marked-slot restoration from a fixed scalar norm budget, requesting its fixed loss before choosing logarithmic accuracy."
  ],
